    "updated_at": "2023-11-20T06:29:58Z",
    "body": "This seems like another case where new CSS features regressed HTML. That argues for changing the layering such that HTML calls even more directly into CSS and CSS maintains the API such that it doesn't break when new features are added.\r\n\r\ncc @tabatkins @svgeesus @whatwg/css ",
