    "updated_at": "2023-12-04T15:08:17Z",
    "body": "> Okay, check https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#parse-color in a few minutes.\r\n\r\nNice, but also needs a copy in CSS Color 5, because Color 4 doesn't have, for example, [Resolving color-mix()](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-5/#resolving-mix)\r\n",
