    "updated_at": "2023-12-04T19:12:50Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure I understand. The text covers future additions to `<color>` just fine as-is, yeah? It just invokes \"resolve\", and Color 5 adds additional ways to resolve a color.\r\n\r\nWhen we un-delta Color 5 it'll move over, but I don't see any particular need to duplicate it right now.",
